{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45069","headline":"伏日就汤评事衡湖上避暑 · 皎然","name":"伏日就汤评事衡湖上避暑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大火方燥石，停云昼亦收。\n将从赏心侣，寸景难远游。\n拥几苦炎伏，出门望汀洲。\n回溪照轩宇，广陌临梧楸。\n释闷命雅瑟，放情思乱流。\n更持无生论，可以清烦忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45069.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45069","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}